-- Draft French and Portuguese translations of all 974 screening questions
-- (machine translation, 2026-10-21). They go in as status 'draft' / source
-- 'machine', so NOBODY taking a screening sees them until a reviewer approves
-- each one on /translations. Matched to questions by their English text.
-- Re-running is safe: existing translations (including reviewed ones) are kept.

