  ($q$Does the child present with heightened tactile defensiveness during grooming tasks such as haircuts or nail trimming?$q$, 'pt', $q$A criança apresenta defensividade tátil aumentada em tarefas de higiene, como cortar o cabelo ou as unhas?$q$),
  ($q$Does the child demonstrate tactile avoidance of messy play materials such as sand, mud, or textured foods?$q$, 'fr', $q$L'enfant évite-t-il au toucher les matières salissantes, comme le sable, la boue ou les aliments texturés ?$q$),
  ($q$Does the child demonstrate tactile avoidance of messy play materials such as sand, mud, or textured foods?$q$, 'pt', $q$A criança mostra evitamento tátil de materiais que sujam, como areia, lama ou alimentos com textura?$q$),
